# Excel Lab 1 – Exploring DMart Sales Data

## 📌 Overview

This lab focuses on understanding the **DMart sales dataset**, its business context, key fields, and basic Git/GitHub workflow.

## 🎯 Tasks Completed

* Explored the **DMart sales dataset**
* Identified key fields and business metrics
* Examined regions and product categories
* Identified total records and dataset structure
* Set up **Git and GitHub**
* Created a repository and pushed the dataset

## 🛠️ Skills Used

* Microsoft Excel
* Data Exploration
* Dataset Understanding
* Git
* GitHub
* Version Control

## 📊 Dataset

**DMart Sales Dataset**

## ✅ Status

Lab completed and uploaded to GitHub.
